<title>USA: US House tax chair to give tax bill details Monday.</title>
<headline>US House tax chair to give tax bill details Monday.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>House Ways and Means Committee Chairman Bill Archer, a Texas Republican, is scheduled to provide details of tax legislation Monday, the committee said Friday.</p>
<p>The bill is expected to go before the full panel for consideration Wednesday.</p>
<p>The legislation is to fill in the details of the broad outline agreed to by congressional leaders and the White House last month. That agreement called for $85 billion in net tax cuts over five years.</p>
</text>
